  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Georgia Thematic Pooled Fund (UNGTPF) - Civic Space in 2025-2027 will aim to support civil society and independent media in Georgia aiming to further advance the 2030 Agenda in the spirit of Leaving No One Behind (LNOB) principle. In 2025-2027 UNGTPF aims to provide support to civil society and independent media with the estimated funding requirements of USD10 million which could be further updated.</narrative>
